---
// Opens with the thesis, not a features list. Also lays down the honesty
// beat immediately — a Gen Z audience clocks a fake "we win everything"
// sweep on sight, so we say so before the first competitor shows up.
---
<section class="hero rd-section">
  <div class="rd-container hero-inner" data-reveal>
    <p class="rd-kicker" data-reveal-item><span class="kdot"></span>The comparison page, not the sweep</p>

    <h1 class="hero-title" data-reveal-item>
      Planners tell you <em class="rd-em">when.</em>
      Flashcard apps tell you <em class="rd-em">how.</em>
      <span class="hero-title-line">
        Nobody tells you <span class="hero-flourish-wrap">what's next<svg class="hero-flourish" viewBox="0 0 300 26" width="300" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><path data-hero-flourish d="M4 18C48 4 96 4 140 15C184 26 232 6 296 12" /></svg></span>.
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-sub" data-reveal-item>
      We looked at seven other apps students actually use. Below is what each one
      is genuinely good at, where it stops, and why we built the thing that sits
      in the gap.
    </p>

    <nav class="hero-index" data-reveal-item aria-label="On this page">
      <a href="#map">The map</a>
      <a href="#field">The field</a>
      <a href="#glance">At a glance</a>
      <a href="#honest">When not to pick us</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 10vw, 112px) clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
  }

  .kdot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--rd-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px oklch(65% 0.2 2 / 0.16);
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.4vw, 60px);
    max-width: 19ch;
    line-height: 1.06;
  }

  .hero-title-line {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--rd-ink-soft);
  }

  .hero-flourish-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--rd-ink);
  }

  .hero-flourish {
    position: absolute;
    left: -2%;
    bottom: -0.32em;
    width: 104%;
    height: 0.42em;
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-flourish path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--rd-accent);
    stroke-width: 5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin-top: 28px;
    max-width: 54ch;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 18.5px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--rd-ink-soft);
  }

  .hero-index {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .hero-index a {
    font-family: var(--rd-body);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--rd-ink-soft);
    background: oklch(100% 0 0 / 0.5);
    border: 1.5px solid oklch(52% 0.06 305 / 0.18);
    border-radius: var(--rd-r-pill);
    padding: 8px 16px;
    transition: color 150ms, border-color 150ms, transform 0.2s var(--rd-ease-bounce);
  }

  .hero-index a:hover {
    color: var(--rd-ink);
    border-color: var(--rd-grape);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hero-index a::before {
    content: '→ ';
    color: var(--rd-accent);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-index a:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { svgDraw, initMarketingMotion } from '../../../lib/marketing/motion';

  initMarketingMotion();
  svgDraw('[data-hero-flourish]', { start: 'top 88%', duration: 0.9, ease: 'power2.out' });
</script>
